							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><div align="center"><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=586624" target="_blank"> <img src="http://www.fotguild.com/images/09.20.04/sys_sig6.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><br />L70 Lord<br />Officer of Fires of Time<br /></div>
