	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg5046"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1" title="View the profile of Kinladar">Kinladar</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Ranger Bait<br />
								Moderator<br />
								Veeshan<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 14333<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/macross.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								My Avatar can beat up your avatar!<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/kinladar@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="kinladar@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org" title="http://www.rodcetnife.org" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:truman@thewavz.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=603.msg5046#msg5046"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=603.msg5046#msg5046">Re:Suggestions</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> January 27, 2004, 03:23:44 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							The procs on that, with the aug would make it a nice aggro keeper, especially when with pally stuns added in.<br /><br />I wouldn&#039;t worry about switching out for a tanking weapon, for a DPS roll, just get a windblade for a bazaar DPS, but a windblade lacks some of the frosty&#039;s stats too.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Guild Leader of <a href="http://www.fotguild.com" target="_blank">Fires of Time</a><br /><br /><span style="font-family: 2;">A little piece of paper with a picture drawn<br />&nbsp;floats on down the street till the wind is gone. <br />The memory now is like the picture was then, <br />When the paper&#039;s crumpled up, it can&#039;t be perfect again. </span>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg5047"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202" title="View the profile of xaanru">xaanru</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 51<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								I&#039;m not a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.sonsofkings.com" title="Sons of Kings Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=603.msg5047#msg5047"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=603.msg5047#msg5047">Re:Suggestions</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> January 27, 2004, 04:21:09 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Heavy windrider&#039;s lance<br /><br /><a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=17983" target="_blank">http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=17983</a><br /><br />According to Allakhazam&#039;s it outdamages windblade, and costs about half as much.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Xaanru 66th lvl Archon of Marr <br />&lt;Sons of Kings&gt; Rodcet Nife <br />Grandmaster Smith(250)* GM Trophy<br />Grandmaster Jeweler (250)<br />Grandmaster Tailor (250)<br />Master Baker(200)<br />Master Fletcher (200)<br />Master Jeweler (200)<br />Master Brewer (200)<br />Master Potter (194)<br />Master Fisherman (186)<br />Master Drunk (189)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg5107"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52" title="View the profile of Gabus">Gabus</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 276<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/psychotic-day.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I beat the Internet. The end guy was hard.<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=603.msg5107#msg5107"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=603.msg5107#msg5107">Re:Suggestions</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #4 on:</b> January 30, 2004, 08:34:57 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Thanks for the responses. It is somewhat comforting to know that I am not terribly &quot;off&quot; in using that my frostreaver. I will have to look at the windrider lance, my piercing skill is maxed, but it has been a long time since I have seen a piercer worth my trouble.<br /><br />Maybe I will get rid of my longblade of vitality (since I never seem to want to go 1 hander and shield anymore) and see what I can find in the bazzar. <br /><br />Thanks
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=139779" target="_blank">Gabus Magelo Profile</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
